<p>
Loving God,
</p>

<p>
Apathy is a vice<br>
easily disguised<br>
behind veils<br>
of busy lives,<br>
carefully built<br>
to avoid the<br>
demands of love.
</p>

<p>
Forgive me,<br>
not just because<br>
I pretend to care,<br>
but that I<br>
deceive myself -<br>
believing in<br>
the pretending<br>
more than<br>
in the caring.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>




